  "design": {
    "idea": "Living Right Shoulder Bellows lung pulsing gusts in lockstep with the giant's Right Step: forge Lance to crack the Magnet Golem's horseshoe, swap to Scatter to clear the Smelter Wasps and Bellows Imp, then ignite all three clustered furnace dampers in one Scatter volley to snap the East Shoulder Chain!",
    "kind": "combat",
    "beat": "ten",
    "teaches": "Live Lance->Scatter temper switching in wind-pulsed combat + 3-target Scatter igniter volley",
    "decisions": 8,
    "expert_s": 55,
    "reward": "col_right_lock+open_r9_east",
    "why": "High-energy combat wing contrasting Left Shoulder's physics puzzle and showcasing Magnet Golem + Scatter synergy.",
